{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 928,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0d44567e8f0d3628308b51e6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中场附近位于队伍中间且\\n附近有其他赛马娘时,速度提升\\n如果视野内有4人以上的赛马娘则效果增强",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d4eabcc3075228c02c27db802ac0b666ff0266294674491c175a2a857a454e6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100551"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf60c11682395e8ea654a00b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛终盘前方受阻时\\n能够借助预言之力开辟道路",
      "source_fingerprint": "7faf7001c95398ff4f3f03bf264663b1c7fc6fe4636ef7c1719b105570651bd7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100561"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a56d299023d867ae9f8bbfbc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛即将进入终盘时的某刻位于后方时\\n速度持续上升。若是在中长距离比赛中\\n距离领先位置越远则效果越强",
      "source_fingerprint": "266151786cd065bbad05c05fac67bcea22312698e2a51c733a86b6a4732d7e7b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100571"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e8aa9b64718c15b363788a0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘完成超越时\\n会以永不放弃之心向前突进",
      "source_fingerprint": "557e1b41d5f085f623324830121bea3bfda9ecb1a1bbd9df72aabb9a1c33813f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100581"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81c1419c18f1576a8e4ecf0e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "保持冷静进入中盘并准备发力时\\n或是在终盘胜负关键的弯道\\n位于中部梯队时,会振作精神提升加速力",
      "source_fingerprint": "0eecd7351bbf2624b1ce7a3312a7a0a56dd75c612f3475aef19d8402b82b82e8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100591"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dfeb0628bb7f95fc079e6b90",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛终盘处于第三名快要输掉的时候\\n激发潜藏的昂扬斗志,速度加快",
      "source_fingerprint": "30a5f1420dfe2efcdeea52bcf95cbb06459dc90735aa8af2824c994478405d56",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100601"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:857e7756fec354c18c754444",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘时,大幅回复持久力\\n＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "364ba72a395d48d1b7cd12f9cf52f138ad9d93164cc8977206eaaaa3110ac36c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100601111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54ee6a4332770e4d07d40fea",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘稍微回复体力\\n并提升速度＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "8baa2e78e20c7d6152c287f90284173e4081d89997c9560a74f0059fe510ca82",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100601121"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:881e85d021fee1acf67bc397",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在弯道上提升加速度\\n并且稍微回复持久力",
      "source_fingerprint": "428166ffb7647066972a3313f1786ecfe6d3caf9d8990be0ede53993d68ba769",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100601211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1eef96694dc256c38f9e6d4d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘时,大幅回复持久力\\n＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "364ba72a395d48d1b7cd12f9cf52f138ad9d93164cc8977206eaaaa3110ac36c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100602111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b5a2fc439f49aae363dd9680",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最终弯道上若身处内道\\n则提升速度并稍微回复持久力\\n＜长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "85da4db05356a174e4e187285e4938d315c843936a5866aa661f30b9c4529647",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100602211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a70e898bbcccd86e3e5398fc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘位于前方时提升速度\n之后若正在进行比拼\n则在剩余200m地点略微提升速度<英里/长距离>",
      "source_fingerprint": "93894c990dee56940a29cbf6fd12a133d781019fa2dbf75166d4e864c35e47d9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100603111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4495b9455e5fa663894a4812",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "若是有马纪念赛道则终盘提升加速度，\n比赛终盘迫近时若位于领头或\n紧跟在领头4马身以内则大幅提升<先行·长距离>",
      "source_fingerprint": "5886358b480e4c3a01980f8f972efc080b5b4091681eb48a0d71109a39ed512f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100603211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db8d9791ebf36d7b5e520979",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘初期位于前方时加速度\n大幅提升，比赛终盘迫近时若位于领头或\n紧跟在领头4马身以内则极大提升<先行·英里>",
      "source_fingerprint": "e7c7f88a896049d292ffd333ec236fbe5b700de68ebd9115f3dc786852610170",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100603221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94c3a80c52616e603d488eef",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "能够冷静地进行比赛的规划时\\n就能够在最后200米发挥实力,大幅加速",
      "source_fingerprint": "6fdefbed2b57ee35b79b7eecbce81b6563f6e361b0a3a6effe165b2159056f9f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100611"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d03e8f3eb0cee8c0d3c2e86a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中期左右处于队伍中团时\\n重新振作,回复持久力\\n并且稍微提高速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "188ffc3e04a40918d2b302180751f9f5ce40869673a65582598f0a91a9ee67b5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100621"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7da05926e41fb4d32ca7461d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "如果能冷静地进行比赛\\n在最终冲刺的关键时刻\\n会持续少量提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "03a61747bc7d5a82c17524c16c23b18aef10b67d814704bc7fc90d9c374a39cb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100631"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea54f51a13dfc660641bfd24",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "从起跑到比赛后半程一直保持在前列的话\\n心情将变得超嗨\\n回复持久力且速度逐渐上升",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1b450ddacdeb27a6345b9e72c864c849a35369b0dbe1d53d24be51ba83b098b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100641"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f7ee050d2b64e6f95bea36d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在临近终盘的某处位于前方时\\n速度少量提升,若是短距离或英里比赛\\n则速度少量持续提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "6719aa5ababc328c98292546e852ab9939eb84c9fe5ce716f46308e9bf16bfb2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100651"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:352dfb60f1f6491d3b915015",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "中盘中段处于领头位置时\\n超长时间内速度持续稍微上升\\n但终盘末段时会微幅逆喷射",
      "source_fingerprint": "39f61438830319135f63c8ee3a3a5bdaacbc4868fec61db72c0577ce16aaa008",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100661"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70752a2efafa1745d9e4b000",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "进入最终直线时,若处于好位置\\n则会怀抱坚强的意志来加快速度\\n若接近领头马娘的话则会大幅提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "49579c1b9d5bcd6d774a8881caf0568b3e162108bfd7be88ce15886f703aef1b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100671"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1211d34271602f74d679b74d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "位于前方,比赛后半的\\n第3弯道中速度稍微提高\\n或者在终盘的看台对面直线赛道上向前强力冲刺",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe67bf16b600a0b84e4f71db7c08dc0940554e0cdda9859e1ce23bf71256e756",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100681"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:82f1f9a58725f855995c6e8e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "剩余300米处于有利位置\\n且与前方赛马娘距离近时\\n强烈的信念将绽放,提高速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "28670afdbd6cc16c6c9b1e951d05c10ad447becf44a04dc1303b9231cf9e1f8b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100691"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a9c093619890db8b8ed53be",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在剩余800m处位于队伍中间时\\n稍微提升加速度,若在2400m的比赛中\\n取得高人气则大幅提升加速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "680ade38f5115fbdcda85131b320912fe56de78476f57f3f116f8181caabe5f0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100701"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ebaa00d3d1a4df6b6c62b694",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "左右移动时,视野小幅变宽广\\n并且稍微回复持久力\\n＜作战・追赶＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d7f5c1726165eeeacb48215c69a8bdc8d59c2c2bf4a167ca18d9cc21752230c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100701111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2bcd484fcbb19ee120d6fdd6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在下坡时回复持久力\\n并且稍微提升速度＜作战・追赶＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "a47c7e660ce488d6ed02afe65c316f267563222a006a763d56e6a9678c99e71c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100701211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f3f1b65c2b975a9e1c0dcb62",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最终弯道上若身处内侧\\n则一段时间内速度持续提升＜长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "43ad05462332e7e395ed9a903165fd06598538b7eca0a23c2931da2bd3d38927",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100702111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bdb4ba03c2650f6c8aecfcb6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘时若身处后方\\n一段时间内速度持续提升＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "bae5ae6b4cafa1681f3f7f297ad191beb904f6a7abe67e1e047d4a31cf5bcbc6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100702211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cff912d07bda380c1fa698f3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘位于后方时\\n速度大幅提升＜长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "0344efc3875e3615bed95fb82d95c1e3e1fc23f13d8d59181a8c2a9a42ef608c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100702221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5cd20ef03b2efbae3996a1f3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在最后冲刺阶段的直线上加速度提升\\n并在最终直线上速度稍微提升\\n＜作战・追赶＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "820c61e810929f5bd663aee16c2e554d6a854272ae10170de1a1890932a7b6c1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100703111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8c2ad30c9b70fa1641ef3cde",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "擅长「稍重」「重」「不良」的马场状态\\n大幅提升速度与力量\\n但是由于得意忘形\\n出迟的时间变长",
      "source_fingerprint": "e293b208ff79100effda47f7d9651e773d29a4529e5e3817e85eba44d69b87ca",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100703211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:86229d7985f3a5a41c141771",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "从比赛中段进行长距离冲刺\\n速度略微加快",
      "source_fingerprint": "c4f47551096c00a4eab46568f70391d450f2cdec61f285379fe4021cd894bb7b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "10071"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:91858fe23c662a289eff31d3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最终直线上与后方赛马娘距离近的话\\n在这瞬间消耗些许持久力\\n快速提高速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "43937c085d7e6f5c36451014991e352fcf732b030a6de9bb4e11dcb98b654cb1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100711"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:90d3b361581b9e36344feed8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最终弯道后完成超车\\n且在最后300米位于前方集团时\\n会燃起烈焰般的斗争心,提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c5cf62d378b746f295b64dbf5234765a87c1d19c395087c04066618d137341e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100721"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca90ddfa9e7f3471e49257b4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘进行超越时\\n在最终直线上速度提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "8830bb91728f26d5e2ebc4bf6102d49d0ce5739d89bd170fe03201de9974ed9a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100731"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0d483e824bf285a9694dffa",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "赛程后半段\\n在中团位置根据剩余持久力进行相应的长距离冲刺\\n速度逐渐小幅度提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "263abe1eba4689a14a074bf3456aecfca854dade66b6db7ce09c8ab5f1cf0952",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100741"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:403d605af3e4ed26451946bf",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "如果在比赛半程处于中间梯队,速度会少量提升\\n若是长距离比赛,速度提升的持续时间将延长\\n并恢复大量体力",
      "source_fingerprint": "166a67f7db92d969c20b0177d2c20c5e89199f8d546317785bdcb3b0ec96e37a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100761"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc752a307488a5539a66fa7f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "临近终盘若位于好位置,则在剩余400m的地方\\n大幅提升速度,在长距离发动该技能时\\n若位于领头或距离领头1马身以内\\n则极大提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b3dfb9141dc5fc971e6d1c71834279d081693e15f789db57348ebb2e5928a6d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100771"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:61e5bf874dde6a66ce7ce240",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "赛程前半段压低节奏,最终弯道后半段\\n若位于前方则可长时间持续稍微提高加速度\\n若处于第2名则效果增加",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe3e6889e51afe9e4553d3836b402d2d3d038e3c1165ce3b40b5f9a3b2d60ae0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100781"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d849209784a1847ec5314e7a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘在前方竞争时\\n则比赛后半段短时间内速度提升\\n若是大井、川崎或者船桥赛场\\n则变为速度持续提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "37421352d2773128cfc5293f02b8b1f366efeb65bbf1c68ea61f18e6d4702b6b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100791"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ddfedee18f9f9318457d3b42",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛前半段一直保持前方位置时\\n若后半段检测到对手发动了加速技能\\n则向前小幅突进,若比赛是URA沙土比赛\\n则额外增加少量速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "a1b960aa68158381cab802a1809cf172ba7a2b9152ec6d6851531e27f4df74fb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100801"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:41028c05b09eb8c654f0a38c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘转入直线时回复持久力\\n并且稍微提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "a07b4d648db4d95a353f13c985fe46db1609e6d4159705e9db10e2e48839cb6d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100801111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc50d62b84910e5749bf3270",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘时若身处后方\\n则加速度大幅提升＜英里＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "a037e46ec14bcff35216344a581a87f905c2b2325db64a5b22b5082ee1a5df32",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100801211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7535614dc61e737d1cba3e4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最后冲刺阶段前方拥挤时\\n会更擅长回避\\n并且稍微回复持久力",
      "source_fingerprint": "e897d506a0e9d89ce9fecea796b778502f525d5be543e0ae987126c8ddb75841",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100802111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e1261e99c00f913809f74e2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最终直线上若身处第二名以后\\n并且与领先位置差距小于四马身时\\n极大幅提升速度＜作战・居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a01af9dc3c8a47e3e709e11bff2f3fcb62e3078d4abda7d02fc5f62818f8f0a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100802211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a4171157f21f7076cc4f68a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在最后200米处于前列进行名次争夺时\\n竞争力变强,速度也会加快",
      "source_fingerprint": "03ed7b9b916458bb4348d7eef6e4d583ff967793caef1c407661029e02f62389",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "10081"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92ea74f0f132cce6d5230e90",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛终盘的弯道中，短时间内\\n会略微向前冲出，在泥地比赛中效果\\n增加并且加速力会少量提升\\n＜领放/先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "9592eeca6d63c1eb3648d9ac031470ec511e838e4413c195925cd6fa5811fe2f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100811"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3368916a56bea57615b39145",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在最终弯道位于好位置时\\n短时间内速度提升,若是英里比赛\\n则效果时间增加",
      "source_fingerprint": "bdffce9a709cbef414fe214136862762b338124dd3d037ae440d430e0ba5aa24",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100821"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81eeb71b4db20042ab72ccf2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中段附近往后的直线处\\n位于队伍中间时,提升速度,若此时为\\n下坡则持续提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "092dc8e8bbecfc4da1ffe3f6db97c0e6ecc12a220dee8302f402d9aadff7824d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100831"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92cb23ad53489a2bdc801b92",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘位于后方时,在最终直线处\\n解除自我封印向前突进,比赛场地为\\n东京竞马场中距离时,以极快速度向前突进",
      "source_fingerprint": "f8ac4543df0cb72f1ef14ee61bd053752dd11099d04642d2f5d5f59aada3c847",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100841"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae7ffe86cb141b1b60ef7c53",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "冷静地进行比赛,突入终盘时位于后方附近时\\n稍微向前突进,并略微威慑从领头开始\\n至多4名赛马娘",
      "source_fingerprint": "c09901fff9dac45f9fd6c8cec750f3cfc4ee2ab224a79793e62ec24da7e3d656",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100851"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b98c3988868a10c5e53a1ddf",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "剩余1000m时若位于前方\\n则提高速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "0113b21e131ea68105d1b8cfdb68ba454a4ef1609cdd5ddd2fff1ce691c9962b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100861"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:179f39be7393dbac6dae4409",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "剩余400米,位于前方并被后方马娘紧追时\\n跑法让粉丝心中留下深刻印象\\n使自身更容易突围",
      "source_fingerprint": "25fbc0bfc7ff19d133c51eec68e328644501ab264ff738149844ce58df806e3e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100871"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9becf9a94e3a172bf9991f8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最终弯道位于队伍中间时\\n比赛剩余400m后速度提升\\n若是中距离赛在中盘有过赶超\\n则速度大幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "806f23ab8260d3c7dc1a41fbd8ad78f1a82e0d138194d245ff8b460570a57a1a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100881"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:78014798eba68866f10fb121",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中段左右若位于前方\\n则速度提升,并回复少量体力\\n如果比赛距离在2400ｍ及以上\\n回复量增加",
      "source_fingerprint": "1de25e96d7ef61297f227b6ec7df30685cbedd0a7b8032cd23c319bb8fc993df",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100891"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:84c70a2c2725d68e68db86aa",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛前半的弯道中处于前方时\\n速度会在短时间内提升,如果是英里或中距离比赛\\n那么之后在终盘的最后直道被逼近时\\n会在短时间内稍微领先一些＜草地＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "c38bea79edd9b046ed48ae3462d048e471196907c47f3c25a9b7708ce8f2cc08",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100901"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14a63840c5c4d2b746a7a943",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘时若身处前方,速度提升\\n并且稍微回复持久力＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "56637b52c607919a59aa37188dbbdfa678ef4686fc9d981bad99e10657d01904",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100901111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a16d24000dcac43dfb8ecba",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘时若身处前方\\n则回复持久力,并稍微提升速度\\n＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "adc9c411403cfc8cf437a4bfa8f7259f4f4b46748421e834b1d660d8fc2df04b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100901211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81de516a76ca9cec2ac3052a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在上坡时,大幅回复持久力\\n＜作战・领放＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "7326100cf3b6a163cbfb1a40cdfb0351381a2e5716f0c9982f3204fb158469f4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100902111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e24a305e7acd556383408cc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "临近比赛中盘时若位于前方\\n则速度提升,之后最终冲刺时\\n加速度稍微提升＜领放・长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "b046126cc86b98ebc755447be20d03ddd562f1f3b1384453c30b4278f34540b9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100902121"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8784287c09e3ea21cd0ccf1f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在最终直线上身处领先位置\\n并且后方一马身以内有其他赛马娘时\\n速度极大幅提升＜作战・领放＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5e8701d4880e6e601decee3959266fddcf847e262f7ee723970a14edba8d0ea",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100902211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55610861d40eaaea5a3338c9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛后半段前方位置\\n稍微发挥成为第一的力量",
      "source_fingerprint": "5159bc7c73dc7243415e3f78030362cfd7827c05ebc38e8b7781df2f7736d226",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "10091"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7001789ae92f6d841d37b10f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "进入终盘最终直线时若位于队伍中间\\n则剩余300m之后速度少量提升\\n如果能冷静地进行比赛\\n则速度大幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "a50faf9c9e4cbb4426abf9e0de083e6454ae1b0f150d6caae37bb251663bfda4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100911"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f57b6b12cbc57997a0ffc6f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中段附近处于优势位置时\\n速度会提升\\n在中距离比赛中效果会增加",
      "source_fingerprint": "0edacc8dd6fc6a000f37e88c2947bfaa210f0644e24c7e0a3cfc165e7ffe3274",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100921"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce3b73f02c9be67aa832a129",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "终盘初段的某处位于前方时\\n稍微向前突进,若是短距离或英里比赛\\n则提升技能效果",
      "source_fingerprint": "75cc601c8f765c52190c3e49283cdba2b860a734556a378faa16714745ded995",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100931"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:340e48df10bc780ebfd3e795",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛进行一半时位置处于中间梯队\\n则速度提升,若是中距离比赛\\n则速度大幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "0aa259957fd8779ff8194c0c2ecf17c26a6b565893e08f3fee7bdfe478fd466f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100941"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9151f7990884097567026133",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛进入终盘时若位于前方\\n会小幅向前冲出\\n在短距离比赛中则会持续小幅向前冲出\\n直到抵达终点＜作战·先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c5cda5c9a80c0f4120d3e540e760dcdfef510f6d9b0a4a7395984b222467c5b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100951"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:36b9411c1edf93ebbc2e7c9e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛后半的第3弯道处于中团时\\n速度会在短时间内提升\\n之后在终盘的最后直道尝试超越时\\n速度会稍微提升。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d492e56ef5799b4b6d417c4ac74575a12bf734d34e9f0d8734b557e30f718d3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100961"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:577c3a7c0eaead7d28324932",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "剩余300m的位置处在中游位置时\\n速度大幅提升,在中距离比赛发动\\n「冲动」技能的情况下技能效果变为\\n在比赛终盘的弯道无视名次提升加速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "65922299b7f7aef3476e7d90dd801e153162c42b397838dfc9dbf061929706af",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100971"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f4390589836ff7b1758a3ef",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在临近终盘时少量提升速度\\n并且根据发动的绿色技能数\\n额外提升速度和加速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "781e5c7d01b63b93976e3da5e0797ddcd279880343f260c673af5f342bc1b1e7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100981"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd73bb09151e2e2ddb963371",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "沙土比赛时在中盘的弯道上竞争过后\\n在最后冲刺时处于好位置,加速度会略微上升\\n如果余力充足的话效果会上升",
      "source_fingerprint": "683e88c57b2ceedcc9eb55d283f8d687dbdb18de647b1c6c7362483e7208eb1a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100991"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d74c44fb1d6843d7183e256",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "剩余300m时位于前方,则速度少量提升\\n若在沙土比赛中与领头赛马娘距离较近时\\n再稍微向前突进",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab20a710261c3b100854927006fb38b23c4909c3222782960c68705dac174a2b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd7b506b4b6422a7be5168f7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘身处前方时\\n速度大幅提升＜英里＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "af7ab41c486c51e3aae795b6c3dd358692ef4c2f48fa7277352ef0b05ae7f622",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101001111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1db25f90a74a73fa41d50fd5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "临近比赛中盘时若身处前方\\n速度大幅提升＜英里＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "a8f3df13a4da59c090b689d0730543fe7795280b43c0b9c249ed66d388f6273d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101001211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af3cf32110de5ea300038e51",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "临近比赛中盘时若身处前方\\n速度大幅提升＜英里＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "a8f3df13a4da59c090b689d0730543fe7795280b43c0b9c249ed66d388f6273d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101002111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b442b765823003de477e7cb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘开始时若身处前方\\n则加速力大幅提升\\n并且视野稍微变得宽广＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "4772a127d4a149946f23b1da01765114017fdf4f548af336b69493008ac3f2f3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101002211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aeb1a261d4f093077da0e0ef",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘的弯道位于前方时\n持续一段时间稍微提升速度，英里\n比赛中则消耗少量持久力，在持续一段\n时间内极大提升速度<作战·先行>",
      "source_fingerprint": "124d6efaf9bf7e3e8419a30fb6b18fa731b7a280f7113c6f5f3e47aaeb854ca4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101003111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e4dcb47b96862e331a567a14",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘初期提早位于领放或\n试图超越时，或者在终盘初期\n提早提升加速度<先行·英里>",
      "source_fingerprint": "9552079716310fb4278bfebe98406ebf994d78bc92096645a56ed5b0a6ca736a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101003211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ea9883085dd21d9ac4bd405",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛前半段在队伍中间且前方或后方\\n长时间有赛马娘紧贴,则稍微回复体力\\n之后在比赛中段附近的直线处\\n短时间内速度大幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "192967b7ab4c206b8e0b8d6babbb58b20d75859aaf1b2cf1085c882343eb1e9a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "101021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e56e47a698be39f8b5cba85",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘位于前方竞争时\n持续一段时间稍微提升速度\n此外若正在进行比拼，之后\n持续一段时间略微向前突进",
